      "message": "If the goal is to factorize code, maybe having a boolean argument that would generate either valid or invalid configs here would be easier to understand and to maintain that the predefined indexes in the vector for each type of config.\nIt seems that there is never a mix and match of valid or invalid configs used and that we either generate all valid or all invalid configs.",
