      "writtenOn": "2021-01-12T23:35:07Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Having an enum and combining the generators into a single function are orthogonal IMO. The only thing it improves is that it allows defining this enum locally instead of globally. I\u0027ve done that, thanks for the suggestion!\n\nEnum helps when we derive invalid configurations from valid ones. Sometimes we even use the same valid configuration as a starting point for several invalid ones.",
