      "writtenOn": "2021-01-12T10:14:20Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "it is not clear that we are testing the right thing here:\ncreateAudioPatch() is not necessarily failing because the passed configs are invalid for sinks.\nIt will also fail for instance if the HAL does not support a particular patch description. For instance in this case, event if PORT_CONF_MINIMAL is valid, it is not a valid Mix port config a a source for the patch if the sinks are not Device configs.\nThe HAL could well return unsuported operation in this case before invalid arguments",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 414,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 414,
        "endChar": 48
      },
      "revId": "c40732ab392bffa4264e6a18668c5b095b428255",
